# Build-context filter for cloud/companion/Dockerfile (BuildKit honors this
# per-Dockerfile ignore file; Railway uses BuildKit). Keeps the context lean and
# GUARANTEES no copyrighted/heavy data reaches the image alongside the narrow COPYs.
#
# HARD EXCLUDE — copyrighted / heavy corpus (only demo.etsworld ships):
corpus.etsworld
corpus/
samples/
instantiations/
cache/

# Other architecture-v* trees + arch-v6 non-engine data (only architecture-v6/ets ships):
architecture-v2/
architecture-v4/
architecture-v5/
architecture-v6/cache/
architecture-v6/instances/
architecture-v6/tests/

# Frozen snapshots, reports, analysis, verification, root tests — not runtime:
legacy/
_sealed/
reports/
analysis/
verification/
tests/
renders/
reference_sets/

# VCS + caches + build junk:
.git/
.claude/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# Loose data blobs (worlds keep their .etsworld; demo.etsworld is copied explicitly):
*.wav
*.flac
*.mp3
*.npz
*.pkl
